WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.203
Imagine we have two objects.

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:06.157
Now, we add two more.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:10.982
One... Two... Three... Four.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:16.134
When two objects join two more objects, there are four objects altogether.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.026
That is why two plus two equals four.

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:24.349
Starting at two and moving forward two steps also brings us to four.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:29.723
Simple, visual, and always true: two plus two equals four.
